{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"Suddenly changing the alignment of a super powerful creature is likely to have effects metaphysically. If they are on a lair and it's partially powered by their evil intent, maybe the whole thing collapses. Or maybe plans they had in motion change drastically and that has effects. As well, if you're fighting someone and then they become good, they can still want to fight you for bearing them up","created_at":"2021-02-01T04:51:42.326000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"805661635305537538","reply_to_id":"805659823857205292","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
